    "detailed_description": "Join our Discord for updates and community events! <br><br><strong>Untamed is a planned multiplayer survival game where you play as a creature living in a world of overgrown ruins. </strong><br>Choose a species to play as and customize your character with unlimited color combinations and a unique marking system. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570160/extras/2fa41d13ed591d4b7a96b84c2c8a5541.avif?t=1717425114\" width=710 height=270 /></span><br><br>Survive, grow, and form a pack or herd with other players, use teamwork to take down your prey or defend the land you call home. <br>Claim territories, store food, and decorate your space with bits of nature and found artifacts. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570160/extras/de82b5cc0afc5481a2ef6c3aac904c48.avif?t=1717425114\" width=712 height=270 /></span><br><br>Explore the abandoned ruins and find treasures that increase your stats, or stalk and steal from nearby territories. <br>Work together to take down world bosses, uncover secrets, and stay alive. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570160/extras/838d32023dcd35bd9bb492e9c18b53bd.avif?t=1717425114\" width=710 height=270 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Join our Discord for updates and community events! <br><br><strong>Untamed is a planned multiplayer survival game where you play as a creature living in a world of overgrown ruins. </strong><br>Choose a species to play as and customize your character with unlimited color combinations and a unique marking system. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570160/extras/2fa41d13ed591d4b7a96b84c2c8a5541.avif?t=1717425114\" width=710 height=270 /></span><br><br>Survive, grow, and form a pack or herd with other players, use teamwork to take down your prey or defend the land you call home. <br>Claim territories, store food, and decorate your space with bits of nature and found artifacts. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570160/extras/de82b5cc0afc5481a2ef6c3aac904c48.avif?t=1717425114\" width=712 height=270 /></span><br><br>Explore the abandoned ruins and find treasures that increase your stats, or stalk and steal from nearby territories. <br>Work together to take down world bosses, uncover secrets, and stay alive. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2570160/extras/838d32023dcd35bd9bb492e9c18b53bd.avif?t=1717425114\" width=710 height=270 /></span>",
